# Notes
#
# public/fonts/ IS committed on purpose. fonts.googleapis.com is unreachable
# from Iran and mainland China, so a developer in either place could not run
# `npm run fonts` to regenerate them — and those are two of this project's
# actual audiences. Roughly 13 MB, most of it Noto Sans SC.
#
# research/ IS committed on purpose. It is the provenance for every factual
# claim on the site: which source established which figure, and what each
# chapter was deliberately not allowed to say.
dist/
.vercel/
.vercel
.env*
